ors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>To efficiently isolate (2S,3S)-1-halo-2-hydroxy-3-N-(tert-butoxycarbonyl)amino-4-phenylbutanes (1) or (2R,3S)-1-halo-2-hydroxy-3-N-(tert-butoxycarbonyl)amino-4-phenylbutanes (2) with excellent qualities, impurities are eliminated from a mixture containing the above compounds (1) and/or the above compounds (2) by crystallizing the target compounds (1) or (2) in the presence of a solvent comprising a hydrocarbon solvent and then collecting the crystals.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>Selon cette invention, pour isoler efficacement des (2S, 3S)-1-halo-2-hydroxy-3-N-(tert-butoxycarbonyl)amino-4-phénylbutanes (1) ou (2R, 3S)-1-halo-2-hydroxy-3-N-(tert-butoxycarbonyl)amino-4-phénybutanes (2) aux qualités excellentes, on élimine les impuretés d'un mélange contenant les composés précités (1) et/ou (2) en présence d'un solvant comprenant un solvant d'hydrocarbone, puis on récupère les cristaux.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>